silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_27_governance_shacl_deep_dive_sections_02_shacl_as_quotient_constraint_concrete_anchor_3#validationreport silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidationReport is the SHACL validation report: pass/fail per shape; if pass, the data graph belongs to the quotient by the shape predicate. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ValidationReport', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
